@startuml
title ChatHealthy.ai - Servers Component Diagram (v3)\n2026-09-15 - target front-application architecture (current iteration)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #fdfdfd
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "User\n(Browser)" as user

package "SharedServices container - the main" as ss #eef6f5 {
  component "Gate (facade)\nweb-server transport only\nthe only node that knows transport exists\nenters the registry as a pseudo_tool" as gate_ss
  component "UniversalNavigator (main)\nreads the map, drives the route\nparameters + state, render ledger,\ndeterministic merge, sessions, external calls\nthe ONLY node that accepts external traffic\nholds no data" as nav
  component "UtteranceManager (tool)\ndecides whether an utterance is sufficient to\ndispatch to >=1 tool, and dispatches if so (non-blocking)\npreamble + registry fragments, one model call\ncapability: RequestUsersRefinement (the single surface\nthat talks to the user - no tool talks to the user directly)\nRequestUsersRefinement() - UM's own LLM authors the question\n  (no dispatchable route or a missing slot)\nRequestUsersRefinement(question) - a dispatched tool authored\n  the question and the UM delivers it" as um
}

package "FindCare container - satellite" as fc #fdfdfd {
  component "Gate (facade)" as gate_fc
  component "UniversalNavigatorProxy\nrelays both ways, tool-to-tool only\nholds its metadata slice\nrefuses stale metadata" as proxy_fc
  component "provider_search\nindividualProvider (required)" as t_search
  component "specialty_filter\nNUCC funnel - member of\nindividualProvider (Prescribers/Homeopathic)\nAND facility (Ambulatory/Psychiatric/Inpatient)" as t_sf
  component "provider_detail\nindividualProvider\n(also serves facility_detail via entity_type '2')" as t_pd
  component "provider_selection\nindividualProvider" as t_psel
  component "geo\npage-scoped: individualProvider + facility\nresolves free-text geography incl. misspellings\nruns parallel to specialty_filter" as t_geo
  component "facility_search\nfacility (required)" as t_fs
  component "facility_detail\nfacility (view/member)" as t_fd
  component "clinical_trials\nclinicalTrial (required)" as t_ct
}

package "EvaluateCare container - satellite" as ec #fdfdfd {
  component "Gate (facade)" as gate_ec
  component "UniversalNavigatorProxy\nrelays both ways, tool-to-tool only\nholds its metadata slice\nrefuses stale metadata" as proxy_ec
  component "evaluate_providers" as t_ep
  component "evalcare_splash" as t_es
}

database "Tool Registry\nChatHealthyConfig.ToolConfiguration\none live doc per env\ntools + routes + PAGES (members /\nrequired_members / completeness)\ninstance{build,commit,env,live}" as registry
database "MongoDB (Atlas) FrontEnd\nChatHealthyFrontEnd.Users\nSession collection\n(sessions + render ledger rows)" as mongo_fe
database "MongoDB (Atlas) FrontEnd\nChatHealthyFrontEnd.Users\nRegistered Users collection" as mongo_users
database "Served data\nChatHealthyFrontEnd.PublicHealthData\nProvider + SpecialtyMetaData\nversion-bound via ChatHealthyConfig.DBVersions" as mongo_served
database "Pipeline (build side)\nChatHealthyDataPipelines.PipelinePublicHealthData\nNOT read at runtime" as mongo_pipe

user --> gate_ss : client session / static witness /\nthird-party callback
gate_ss --> nav : token + head + params
nav ..> gate_ss : stream the one answer back

nav --> um : dispatch (utterance)
um --> nav : dispatch set (routes)

nav ..> registry : reads live doc at startup
nav --> mongo_fe : sessions, ledger, merge
nav --> mongo_users : registered users

gate_ss --> gate_fc : wire: dispatch out /\ninternal callback / metadata
gate_ss --> gate_ec : wire: dispatch out /\ninternal callback / metadata
gate_fc --> proxy_fc
gate_ec --> proxy_ec

proxy_fc --> t_search : function call
proxy_fc --> t_sf
proxy_fc --> t_pd
proxy_fc --> t_psel
proxy_fc --> t_geo
proxy_fc --> t_fs
proxy_fc --> t_fd
proxy_fc --> t_ct
proxy_ec --> t_ep
proxy_ec --> t_es

t_pd ..> proxy_fc : may_call (a DAG)

t_search --> mongo_served : provider / specialty (served, version-bound)
t_sf --> mongo_served
t_pd --> mongo_served
t_fs --> mongo_served
t_fd --> mongo_served
t_ct --> mongo_served

mongo_pipe ..> mongo_served : migration (human-released, name-preserving)\nEPIC-010-F-108 - not a runtime path

note right of nav
  Five incoming call types, all mapped:
  tool_to_tool, third_party_callback,
  static_witness, client_sessioned,
  internal_callback. Each route carries
  its proof and its timeout facts.
  Render ledger governs paint: reconciles a
  page when every required_member closes OR
  completeness.render_timeout_seconds expires.
end note

note bottom of registry
  One record generated from source at build.
  Presence is the allowlist; subscriptions are
  the dispatch table; may_call is the call map;
  prompt fragments assemble the routing table.
  Pages carry members / required_members /
  completeness (three pages: individualProvider,
  facility, clinicalTrial - details/filter/geo
  are page members, never pages).
end note

note bottom of fc
  Current-state caveats (targets shown above):
  - facility page is newly added; its NUCC filter
    (Ambulatory/Psychiatric/Inpatient) is the
    specialty_filter funnel on the Non-Individual
    partition, mirroring Prescribers/Homeopathic
    on individualProvider - it is not a separate tool.
  - facility_search_tool.py currently ships dead and
    facility tools live under sharedServices/Code, not
    FindCare/ (no feature directory yet) - N44/N47.
  - facility_detail has no own tool today: served by
    provider_detail with entity_type '2'.
  - geo currently sits in the shared library every
    front-end component installs (BUG-003 / N27, open).
end note

@enduml
